OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells in the south, but
OL,7,Fcloudier further north, perhaps with a
OL,8,Fspot of rain. Under calm, clear skies,
OL,9,Fareas of dense fog will develop. A
OL,10,Fchilly night, or cold in rural, clear
OL,11,Fspots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FFog will lift through the
OL,14,Fmorning to bring long spells of
OL,15,Fsunshine, in the south. Cloudier
OL,16,Ffurther north, though it will become
OL,17,Fgradually clearer. Feeling cool, calm
OL,18,Fand dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
