OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FFog
OL,6,Fand frost on Monday morning, then
OL,7,Fsunny break. A cold start again on
OL,8,FTuesday, and a band of rain transits
OL,9,Fthrough. Midler and breezier on
OL,10,FWednesday, with more rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
